{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/Abouthisgame.png?t=1745450852\" /><br><br>Deliver the most radical punch in HYPERFIST, the best first person puncher to ever hit the market (with awesome mecha-fists). After the deed to the planet Earth was acquired by the robotic Khi Corporation, they descended to terraform the whole place into a huge planetary parking lot. Play as the local punk who wants nothing more than to punch the capitalist corpos in their stupid robot faces. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/Gamefeatures.png?t=1745450852\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use your radical mecha-fists</strong> to unleash combos and flashy specials against corporate bots that completely deserve it!<br></li><li><strong>Keep your combo up</strong>, because the more stylishly you play, the more powerful your fists become!<br></li><li><strong>Utilize your many movement abilities</strong> to rush through 3 levels, all full of dangerous enemy encounters!<br></li><li>Punch a path all the way to the top of Khi Corp's tower and <strong>take down the enormous final boss</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Jam to the amazing punk-rock soundtrack</strong> as you fight off waves of robotic enemies!</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/extras/Aboutdevelopment.png?t=1745450852\" /><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689210?t=1745450852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689210/375728d750b28de7e8f0af2ad610405f6beea17b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745450852",